<% layout("/layouts/boilerplate") %>

<div class="pro-index-container pt-5">
    <div class="row justify-content-center">
        <div class="col-lg-9">
            <div class="pro-glass-panel border-0 p-4 p-md-5 mb-5">
                <div class="border-bottom pb-4 mb-4">
                    <h1 class="pro-page-title mb-2 text-start">Privacy Policy</h1>
                    <p class="text-muted">Last Updated: May 4, 2026</p>
                </div>
                
                <div class="policy-content" style="color: #4a4a4a; line-height: 1.8;">
                    <p class="mb-4">At TokTour, we take your privacy seriously. This Privacy Policy outlines how we collect, use, and protect your personal information when you use our platform.</p>

                    <h4 class="fw-bold mt-5 mb-3" style="color: #1a1a2e;">1. Information We Collect</h4>
                    <p>We collect information you provide directly to us, such as when you create an account, update your profile, book a stay, or communicate with us. This may include your name, email address, phone number, payment information, and government-issued ID (for verification).</p>

                    <h4 class="fw-bold mt-5 mb-3" style="color: #1a1a2e;">2. How We Use Your Information</h4>
                    <p>We use your information to provide, improve, and personalize our services. This includes facilitating bookings, processing payments, sending transaction notifications, and providing customer support. We may also use it for security purposes, such as verifying accounts to prevent fraud.</p>

                    <h4 class="fw-bold mt-5 mb-3" style="color: #1a1a2e;">3. Sharing Your Information</h4>
                    <p>We share certain information between Hosts and Guests to facilitate bookings. For example, when a booking is confirmed, we share the Guest's name and contact information with the Host, and vice versa. We do not sell your personal data to third parties.</p>

                    <h4 class="fw-bold mt-5 mb-3" style="color: #1a1a2e;">4. Data Security</h4>
                    <p class="mb-5">We implement industry-standard security measures to protect your personal information. However, no method of transmission over the Internet is 100% secure, and we cannot guarantee absolute security.</p>
                    
                    <p class="text-muted fst-italic">This is a mock privacy policy for demonstration purposes.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
